    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-005",
      "source": "sections/page-005.md",
      "source_hash": "7315cc063d1307656dedf82a6029636802b2138a417468ac110afd7be633300e",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The Chinese table of contents of the HPV vaccine guidance, listing sections from cervical cancer and HPV through target populations, advocacy, service delivery, monitoring, stewardship and financing; the extracted text splits headings from page numbers.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "HPV疫苗指导文件的中文目录，列出从宫颈癌和HPV、目标人群、宣传动员、服务提供、监测到管理和筹资等各节；提取的文本把标题与页码拆开了。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-006",
      "source": "sections/page-006.md",
      "source_hash": "e2925a3652af782b14bf95d2967192caa3ca615fe8087559febcf0502745a8eb",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The Chinese acknowledgements page, explaining that the guidance is based on a March 2006 UNFPA/WHO technical consultation in Montreux and listing participating experts and staff and the WHO departments involved. The extracted text is fragmented, with names and lines cut off.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "中文致谢页，说明本指导文件是在联合国人口基金/世界卫生组织于2006年3月在瑞士蒙特勒召开的技术咨询会议基础上形成的，并列出与会专家、工作人员和参与的世界卫生组织各部门。提取的文本支离破碎，姓名和行文被截断。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-007",
      "source": "sections/page-007.md",
      "source_hash": "cf8f2a5330a013d990eec202c81e10922e96b81f79d64e68190a388017a0f8b3",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The Chinese introduction to the HPV vaccine guidance, explaining its purpose of alerting reproductive health, immunization and cancer programmes to key issues. It describes cervical cancer burden (about 500,000 cases and 250,000 deaths a year, mostly in low-income countries), its link to HPV types 16 and 18, the natural history of infection and screening options such as VIA with cryotherapy. The extracted text interleaves columns and is hard to follow.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "HPV疫苗指导文件的中文引言，说明其目的是提醒生殖健康、免疫和癌症控制规划注意关键问题。文中介绍宫颈癌负担（每年约50万例病例和25万例死亡，大多在低收入国家）、其与HPV 16型和18型的关联、感染的自然史以及筛查方法，如乙酸目测检查（VIA）加冷冻治疗。提取的文本各栏交错，难以连贯阅读。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-008",
      "source": "sections/page-008.md",
      "source_hash": "dd16c8d621eac0250c90bc16cd16118cdd0373aba18d1d0a76690ed3ffe99707",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "A Chinese page describing the 2005 World Health Assembly resolution on cancer prevention and control, which urged attention to preventable cancers and research on a cervical cancer vaccine, with a figure on HPV infection, pre-cancer and cancer by age; the text appears twice in the extraction.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "中文页面介绍2005年世界卫生大会关于癌症预防和控制的决议，该决议敦促关注可预防的恶性肿瘤并促进宫颈癌疫苗研发，并附一幅按年龄显示HPV感染、癌前病变和癌症的图；该段文字在提取结果中出现了两次。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-009",
      "source": "sections/page-009.md",
      "source_hash": "5fd7b460014d4c59efc6f246fb65e12530cc8e73b4b4dab8417ccbd53b0043a5",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Describes in Chinese the two prophylactic HPV vaccines based on virus-like particles, both targeting HPV 16 and 18 and one also types 6 and 11, with near 100% protection against related cervical pre-cancer in trials. A figure shows HPV type distribution in cervical cancer by region; the extracted text is fragmented.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "以中文介绍两种基于病毒样颗粒的预防性HPV疫苗，二者均针对HPV 16型和18型，其中一种还针对6型和11型；在试验中对相关宫颈癌前病变的保护作用接近100%。一幅图显示各地区宫颈癌中HPV型别的分布；提取的文本支离破碎。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-010",
      "source": "sections/page-010.md",
      "source_hash": "31a5d1b0ae67110aed9f6bbcfddcd3f00f30dea57bf1c58488ec375c228e8606",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Continues in Chinese on vaccine efficacy against genital warts and regional variation, ongoing research on duration of protection and special groups, and the ideal target population of girls before sexual debut, with licensing expected for ages 9–26. A footnote notes the expected registration of Gardasil and Cervarix in 2006–2007; the text is fragmented.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "以中文继续介绍疫苗对生殖器疣的效力及地区差异、关于保护持续时间和特殊人群的进行中研究，以及理想的目标人群——开始性生活前的女孩，预计批准的接种年龄为9～26岁。脚注提到Gardasil和Cervarix预计于2006—2007年注册；文本支离破碎。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-011",
      "source": "sections/page-011.md",
      "source_hash": "7c722733fb31a54b611db200875c53dc1d9188d10e6b3f74577d5288d1885d5f",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Discusses in Chinese other groups that might benefit from HPV vaccination, including males, children under 9, people living with HIV, pregnant women and older women, noting that evidence for each is still lacking. The extracted text is fragmented.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "以中文讨论其他可能从HPV疫苗接种中获益的人群，包括男性、9岁以下儿童、HIV感染者、孕妇和年龄较大的妇女，并指出这些人群的证据仍然不足。提取的文本支离破碎。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-012",
      "source": "sections/page-012.md",
      "source_hash": "b068f7255aa8612e4c5d5e57a4027987ee3cf32129b25ce75c10d6e81e282da5",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Describes in Chinese the innovative features of HPV vaccines, linking them to the 2004 global reproductive health strategy and noting the novelty for sexual and reproductive health of a vaccine against a sexually transmitted cancer cause. It mentions the challenge of extending immunization beyond infants; parts of the text are duplicated and interleaved.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "以中文介绍HPV疫苗的创新特征，将其与2004年全球生殖健康战略相联系，并指出一种针对性传播致癌因素的疫苗对性和生殖健康而言是新事物。文中提到将免疫接种扩展到婴儿以外人群的挑战；部分文本重复且交错。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-013",
      "source": "sections/page-013.md",
      "source_hash": "e35e364b171678e6bde8fcebe2a7236cc7ce5a3afa4c716ddd31c6ed0a70810e",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Outlines in Chinese the Global Immunization Vision and Strategy goals to 2015 and how HPV vaccines fit its expanded scope beyond infants, along with roles for cancer control and HIV programmes. The extracted text mixes columns.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "以中文概述到2015年的《全球免疫远景和战略》目标，以及HPV疫苗如何契合其超越婴儿的扩展范围，并介绍癌症控制和HIV规划的作用。提取的文本各栏混杂。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-014",
      "source": "sections/page-014.md",
      "source_hash": "481bd661f7903ec62e18e4d27b98d55dfbe74517c5cf8bae06056decb4292f28",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Discusses in Chinese the HPV vaccine as an opportunity for STI prevention education and as an expensive product, noting likely high prices for developing countries, possible GAVI support and the risk of private-sector introduction widening inequities. It also covers cultural sensitivities in vaccinating young girls; the text is fragmented.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "以中文讨论HPV疫苗既是开展性传播感染预防教育的机会，也是一种昂贵的产品，指出发展中国家可能面临高价格、可能获得全球疫苗和免疫联盟（GAVI）支持，以及由私营部门引进可能加剧不公平的风险。文中还涉及为少女接种疫苗的文化敏感问题；文本支离破碎。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-015",
      "source": "sections/page-015.md",
      "source_hash": "4f091c4f26200452dae1d90e1b187a827599ef96c1502efa454b90ea83601006",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "A short Chinese passage on synergies between immunization, cancer control and reproductive health programmes and the need for international partnerships to secure affordable prices and supply for developing countries; the text is fragmentary.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "一段简短的中文文字，涉及免疫、癌症控制与生殖健康规划之间的协同作用，以及需要建立国际伙伴关系，为发展中国家争取可负担的价格和供应；文本残缺不全。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-016",
      "source": "sections/page-016.md",
      "source_hash": "be7cdf37091bc6004e8d596b2b638ec5dbd206d397bf903f7cf72a6d6a09185f",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Covers in Chinese advocacy, information and communication for HPV vaccines, stressing balanced public education about HPV, cervical cancer and the vaccines' benefits and limits. It lists key messages, such as HPV causing 99% of cervical cancers, its high transmissibility, and that vaccines protect only against certain types and not other STIs including HIV.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "以中文介绍HPV疫苗的宣传动员、信息和传播，强调就HPV、宫颈癌以及疫苗的益处和局限性开展均衡的公众教育。文中列出关键信息，如99%的宫颈癌由HPV引起、HPV传染性很强，以及疫苗只能预防某些型别，不能预防包括HIV在内的其他性传播感染。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-017",
      "source": "sections/page-017.md",
      "source_hash": "00592a39b58548b57514edb288c6bc1d896b72d65d5693dbadcb6301430af13c",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Continues in Chinese the key messages, noting that about 30% of cervical cancers are not prevented by current vaccines so screening must continue, and advising culturally sensitive messaging that includes boys. It begins the advocacy action points; the text is fragmented.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "以中文继续介绍关键信息，指出现有疫苗不能预防约30%的宫颈癌，因此必须继续开展筛查，并建议采用具有文化敏感性、把男孩也包括在内的宣传信息。随后开始列出宣传动员的行动要点；文本支离破碎。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-018",
      "source": "sections/page-018.md",
      "source_hash": "e3064c371f7c77658c6358712081481410a42123216b0c0a62cd89df7ed51d31",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Describes in Chinese tailored messages for policy-makers, programme managers and providers and for civil society and professional groups, covering disease burden, programme benefits, screening methods, partnerships and vaccine safety. The extracted text is fragmented.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "以中文介绍针对政策制定者、规划管理者和服务提供者以及民间社会和专业团体的有针对性的信息，内容涉及疾病负担、规划效益、筛查方法、伙伴关系和疫苗安全性。提取的文本支离破碎。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-019",
      "source": "sections/page-019.md",
      "source_hash": "fe1892e60b1a06ba6924344ae4b3240750271c59bd047d9bec6d20db7007a7c6",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Discusses in Chinese HPV vaccine service delivery to the primary target group of young adolescent girls through school-based or immunization programme approaches, drawing on reproductive health programmes' experience with sensitive topics. The text is fragmented.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "以中文讨论如何通过学校或免疫规划途径向主要目标人群——青春期早期女孩——提供HPV疫苗服务，并借鉴生殖健康规划处理敏感话题的经验。文本支离破碎。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-020",
      "source": "sections/page-020.md",
      "source_hash": "a6e88dd443545f56a80a801e033815e8a3eab28ce84180730143f1de02412e98",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Describes in Chinese the secondary target group of unvaccinated women aged 14–26, whose coverage depends on national resources, and the need to keep screening older and vaccinated women. It advises against stand-alone HPV programmes and urges using existing systems such as the vaccine cold chain.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "以中文介绍次要目标人群，即14～26岁未接种过疫苗的女性，对其覆盖程度取决于国家资源，并指出仍需为年龄较大和已接种的妇女继续开展筛查。文中建议不要设立独立的HPV规划，并敦促利用现有系统，如疫苗冷链。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-021",
      "source": "sections/page-021.md",
      "source_hash": "49c156314f62145e7cb41aeb8bb5079a9467cb3c44fe1bb1bc5ba4d24c93e4dd",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Discusses in Chinese partnerships between national immunization, reproductive health, adolescent health, cancer and HIV programmes, education and civil society, and monitoring and evaluation, including adverse event reporting with HIV and pregnancy status and long-term impact on cancer. It begins the list of service delivery action points; the text is fragmented.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "以中文讨论国家免疫、生殖健康、青少年卫生、癌症控制和HIV规划与教育部门及民间社会之间的伙伴关系，以及监测和评估，包括结合HIV感染状况和妊娠状况报告不良事件，以及对癌症的长期影响。随后开始列出服务提供的行动要点；文本支离破碎。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-022",
      "source": "sections/page-022.md",
      "source_hash": "35b79ad23048d6837ec0aa8cc8c8934a0c696bdcf136bf05e53af72f00200477",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Lists in Chinese further action points on service delivery and comprehensive cervical cancer prevention, such as extending immunization services, consistent messaging, health worker training, screening and treatment, and monitoring indicators. The extracted text is fragmented.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "以中文列出关于服务提供和宫颈癌综合预防的更多行动要点，如扩展免疫服务、统一宣传口径、培训卫生工作者、筛查和治疗以及监测指标。提取的文本支离破碎。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-023",
      "source": "sections/page-023.md",
      "source_hash": "a9faef619d1dc6d99d82237ecfa6dd10c2268d5493539bd30381b91203c7c523",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Discusses in Chinese stewardship and financing for HPV vaccine introduction, including resource mobilisation, epidemiological evidence, demand forecasting and the importance of international commitments through GAVI, UNICEF and PAHO to expand supply and secure prices. The extracted text is heavily interleaved.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "以中文讨论引进HPV疫苗的管理和筹资，包括资源筹措、流行病学证据、需求预测，以及通过GAVI、联合国儿童基金会和泛美卫生组织作出国际承诺以扩大供应和确保价格的重要性。提取的文本严重交错。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-024",
      "source": "sections/page-024.md",
      "source_hash": "3fce92da8dd01efcdcdafc2072f2af90e597d55b7da5613ae462c6526a10cbdf",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Lists in Chinese the financing action points, such as a national HPV vaccine working group, demand and cost modelling, and aligning resource mobilisation with multi-year immunization and sector-wide plans; the text is fragmented.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "以中文列出筹资方面的行动要点，如成立国家HPV疫苗工作组、建立需求和成本模型，以及使资源筹措与多年免疫计划和全部门计划相一致；文本支离破碎。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-025",
      "source": "sections/page-025.md",
      "source_hash": "2f6f4dc96e2bb6d01b4ef6297a91421f5ae77847a29944d6c0662a5efec800f8",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "A short Chinese fragment on reproductive health programmes contributing to GAVI applications and WHO/UNFPA technical help for countries not eligible for GAVI.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "一段简短的中文片段，涉及生殖健康规划参与准备GAVI资助申请，以及世界卫生组织/联合国人口基金为不符合GAVI资助条件的国家提供技术援助。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-69384-chi/blocks/prose-page-026",
      "source": "sections/page-026.md",
      "source_hash": "936ea015824abfde1c54c7fca45f616d0aecc7516f60e99634ae3963db9da575",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The Chinese conclusion, stating that HPV vaccines meet an important public health need within comprehensive cervical cancer control, that equity for poorer women must be addressed, and that introduction decisions rest with countries; it also notes the 2006 FDA approval of the quadrivalent vaccine.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "中文结束语，指出HPV疫苗在宫颈癌综合控制中满足了重要的公共卫生需求，必须解决贫困妇女的公平问题，是否引进由各国决定；文中还提到美国食品药品监督管理局（FDA）于2006年批准了四价疫苗。",
          "lang": "zh",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
